{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n \n \n \n \n \n ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます。櫻坂46の関有美子です🐱\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 最近の写真をぺたりと。\n \n #ゆみこかめら\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1J7FSD4A6Z2P5WQ5FH87M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1JAB58BMY1TH4BATW87HG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1JCBA3PM2TAR2BWYPV665","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 晴れた日に木漏れ日をうつす地面がすきなんです。\n なんか夏って感じがしません？\n わたしだけかな。\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1JF97JEMVAC4XJWNTKKAS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 空とか植物もすきだけど地面撮るのすき！\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1JJ2FXBS79753H6GEGBXD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n リハ。\n 高校生みたいだねって言いながら撮った📷\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1JM4JEDQSGRXR4FQ98TEH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1JPJ6MKJ6NMJJT2AJAFSB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1JRK11N87NXCG9AQHR6E7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1JSXV7FBEK5ZSW0CBE6JR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1JVWCB52HR2G17APTCTY1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 保乃さん多めの最近のわたしたち。\n \n \n 最近は特に音楽をずっと聴いてます。\n 家にいても移動中も流しっぱなし。\n \n また聴いてる音楽を紹介しますね！\n \n \n \n 明日明後日はサイン会と全握ミーグリです！\n 楽しみに待ってます☺︎\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG1JXC8HXZ6WQ5A22KGZKDD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n カメラロールに